1
00:00:00,450 --> 00:00:02,320
Everyone asks us the same thing.

2
00:00:02,360 --> 00:00:06,346
Why WondrPay, when cards, crypto wallets and Binance Pay

3
00:00:06,226 --> 00:00:07,313
already exist?

4
00:00:07,353 --> 00:00:08,736
Here's the honest answer.

5
00:00:08,776 --> 00:00:11,749
Each of them breaks in one of three places:

6
00:00:11,629 --> 00:00:13,607
cost, safety, or simplicity.

7
00:00:13,647 --> 00:00:15,257
We fixed all three at once.

8
00:00:16,137 --> 00:00:17,210
Cards and Stripe.

9
00:00:17,250 --> 00:00:20,712
A shop pays 2 to 3 percent, waits days for its money,

10
00:00:20,592 --> 00:00:22,604
and loses to chargeback fraud.

11
00:00:22,644 --> 00:00:24,973
With WondrPay, it pays half a percent,

12
00:00:24,853 --> 00:00:27,589
the money lands in its own wallet in seconds,

13
00:00:27,469 --> 00:00:30,321
and a refund needs proof from a verified human,

14
00:00:30,201 --> 00:00:32,763
stored on Arkiv, where no one can edit it.

15
00:00:33,643 --> 00:00:35,875
Crypto wallets, like MetaMask.

16
00:00:35,915 --> 00:00:37,356
A seed phrase you'll lose.

17
00:00:37,396 --> 00:00:38,913
Gas you have to buy first.

18
00:00:38,953 --> 00:00:42,698
42-character addresses that scammers copy with lookalikes.

19
00:00:42,738 --> 00:00:44,088
That's address poisoning.

20
00:00:44,128 --> 00:00:46,880
And approve buttons that can drain a wallet years later.

21
00:00:46,920 --> 00:00:48,773
WondrPay has no seed phrase.

22
00:00:48,813 --> 00:00:50,860
The key is locked by your fingerprint,

23
00:00:50,740 --> 00:00:51,570
on your phone.

24
00:00:51,610 --> 00:00:53,152
No gas: we pay it.

25
00:00:53,192 --> 00:00:56,270
You pay names, like priya.wondrpay.eth,

26
00:00:56,150 --> 00:00:58,773
and shops carry a verified badge.

27
00:00:58,813 --> 00:01:00,567
And there are no approvals at all.

28
00:01:00,607 --> 00:01:03,528
You sign one exact amount, to one recipient,

29
00:01:03,408 --> 00:01:04,865
valid for 10 minutes.

30
00:01:04,905 --> 00:01:07,449
Even our own relayer can't change where it goes.

31
00:01:08,329 --> 00:01:10,865
Custodial apps, like Binance Pay.

32
00:01:10,905 --> 00:01:12,961
Easy, but the money isn't yours.

33
00:01:13,001 --> 00:01:15,917
Accounts get frozen, and platforms can fail.

34
00:01:15,957 --> 00:01:17,763
WondrPay never holds your money.

35
00:01:17,803 --> 00:01:19,640
It goes straight from your wallet,

36
00:01:19,520 --> 00:01:20,347
to the shop's.

37
00:01:21,227 --> 00:01:24,184
Crypto checkouts, like Coinbase Commerce,

38
00:01:24,064 --> 00:01:25,084
stop at paid.

39
00:01:25,124 --> 00:01:27,909
Refunds are manual, there are no subscriptions,

40
00:01:27,789 --> 00:01:29,780
and the customer still needs gas.

41
00:01:29,820 --> 00:01:30,918
We ship all three.

42
00:01:31,798 --> 00:01:33,407
What's new isn't one feature.

43
00:01:33,447 --> 00:01:34,691
It's the combination.

44
00:01:34,731 --> 00:01:37,775
UPI's two-tap experience, on digital dollars,

45
00:01:37,655 --> 00:01:40,438
with one real human behind every account,

46
00:01:40,318 --> 00:01:41,543
through World ID.

47
00:01:41,583 --> 00:01:43,734
That one rule makes everything else safe.

48
00:01:43,774 --> 00:01:45,869
Cashback can't be farmed by bots.

49
00:01:45,909 --> 00:01:48,347
Refunds can't be abused by fake accounts.

50
00:01:48,387 --> 00:01:51,340
And every reward is paid from fees we've already earned,

51
00:01:51,220 --> 00:01:52,858
never from a token we printed.

52
00:01:53,738 --> 00:01:56,787
We go shops first, because shops bring shoppers.

53
00:01:56,827 --> 00:02:00,201
A shop joins in minutes, with our WooCommerce plugin,

54
00:02:00,081 --> 00:02:02,656
a Shopify guide, or just a payment link.

55
00:02:02,696 --> 00:02:04,586
No code, no setup fee.

56
00:02:04,626 --> 00:02:07,594
We start where people already hold dollars,

57
00:02:07,474 --> 00:02:11,370
and W Group already has users: Gulf workers paying family

58
00:02:11,250 --> 00:02:14,351
in India, Ukrainian freelancers paid in USDT,

59
00:02:14,231 --> 00:02:17,265
and savers in Turkey, Nigeria and Argentina.

60
00:02:17,305 --> 00:02:19,605
Shoppers come for zero gas and cashback,

61
00:02:19,485 --> 00:02:22,057
and stay because it's faster than their bank.

62
00:02:22,097 --> 00:02:25,034
10 free transfers a month to friends pulls in the next

63
00:02:24,914 --> 00:02:25,295
user.

64
00:02:25,335 --> 00:02:27,283
WhiteBIT is the way in and out:

65
00:02:27,163 --> 00:02:29,405
dollars in, rupees and hryvnias out.

66
00:02:29,445 --> 00:02:33,935
Year one: 5,000 shops, and 100,000 verified people.

67
00:02:34,815 --> 00:02:36,818
For mainnet, we have three steps.

68
00:02:36,858 --> 00:02:38,671
An audit of our three contracts.

69
00:02:38,711 --> 00:02:40,388
The fee split, on-chain.

70
00:02:40,428 --> 00:02:43,483
And key recovery, so a lost phone isn't lost money.

71
00:02:43,523 --> 00:02:46,531
Everything else runs today, on Whitechain testnet.

72
00:02:47,411 --> 00:02:48,609
Cheaper than cards.

73
00:02:48,649 --> 00:02:49,876
Safer than wallets.

74
00:02:49,916 --> 00:02:51,922
Yours, unlike exchanges.

